WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.965
Raw collection needs processing before reliable analysis.

00:00:02.965 --> 00:00:06.648
Start by assigning stable identifiers to sources and artifacts.

00:00:06.648 --> 00:00:10.331
Group material by information need, source category, date, entity,

00:00:10.331 --> 00:00:14.424
or event while preserving the link to the original record.

00:00:14.424 --> 00:00:15.242
Deduplicate carefully.

00:00:15.242 --> 00:00:18.107
Multiple pages may repeat one original claim,

00:00:18.107 --> 00:00:21.790
and treating them as independent sources creates false confidence.

00:00:21.790 --> 00:00:25.473
Track the earliest known origin and relationships among copies.

00:00:25.473 --> 00:00:28.338
Preserve meaningful differences, corrections, and publication times.

00:00:28.338 --> 00:00:32.430
Use tags consistently for entities, locations, systems, organizations, and themes.

00:00:32.430 --> 00:00:36.932
Entity extraction can accelerate organization, but names and identifiers require verification.

00:00:36.932 --> 00:00:40.206
Similar names do not prove the same identity,

00:00:40.206 --> 00:00:44.298
and one online identifier may be reused, shared, or reassigned.

00:00:44.298 --> 00:00:46.754
Timelines reveal sequence, delay, and contradiction.

00:00:46.754 --> 00:00:52.074
Normalize time zones and distinguish publication time from event time and collection time.

00:00:52.074 --> 00:00:54.530
Relationship maps can show documented connections,

00:00:54.530 --> 00:00:59.850
but every edge should cite evidence and describe what the connection actually means.

00:00:59.850 --> 00:01:03.124
Separate facts, source claims, assumptions, and analytical judgments.

00:01:03.124 --> 00:01:07.216
A fact may be directly supported by a reliable record.

00:01:07.216 --> 00:01:10.081
A claim is what a source says.

00:01:10.081 --> 00:01:12.536
An assumption fills a working gap.

00:01:12.536 --> 00:01:14.173
A judgment interprets evidence.

00:01:14.173 --> 00:01:18.266
Keeping these categories visible prevents inference from becoming accidental fact.

00:01:18.266 --> 00:01:19.903
Maintain traceability through processing.

00:01:19.903 --> 00:01:21.130
Summaries, tables, translations,

00:01:21.130 --> 00:01:26.041
and visual maps should point back to source identifiers and preserved context.

00:01:26.041 --> 00:01:32.180
Processing is successful when it reduces noise and exposes gaps without erasing provenance or uncertainty.
